{"divisionId":3261,"date":"2025-03-24T00:00:00","number":4,"notes":null,"title":"Local Authorities (Changes to Years of Ordinary Elections) (England) Order 2025","isWhipped":true,"isGovernmentContent":false,"authoritativeContentCount":63,"authoritativeNotContentCount":163,"divisionHadTellers":true,"tellerContentCount":63,"tellerNotContentCount":163,"memberContentCount":61,"memberNotContentCount":161,"sponsoringMemberId":4341,"isHouse":true,"isInquorate":false,"amendmentMotionNotes":"<p>Baroness Pinnock moved that a Humble Address be presented to His Majesty praying that the Local Authorities (Changes to Years of Ordinary Elections) (England) Order 2025, laid before the House on 11 February, be annulled, as it denies timely democratic representation to a substantial portion of the electorate; undermines local democratic accountability; disrupts established electoral cycles; lacks sufficient consultation; and erodes the democratic mandate for major restructuring of local government (SI 2025/137). The House divided:</p>","isGovernmentWin":true,"remoteVotingStart":"2025-03-24T19:10:10","remoteVotingEnd":"2025-03-24T19:18:10","divisionWasExclusivelyRemote":false,"contentTellers":[{"memberId":4215,"name":"Lord Stoneham of Droxford","listAs":"Stoneham of Droxford, L.","memberFrom":"Life peer","party":"Liberal Democrat","partyColour":"fc7d0b","partyAbbreviation":"LD","partyIsMainParty":true},{"memberId":4337,"name":"Baroness Janke","listAs":"Janke, B.","memberFrom":"Life peer","party":"Liberal Democrat","partyColour":"fc7d0b","partyAbbreviation":"LD","partyIsMainParty":true}],"notContentTellers":[{"memberId":4153,"name":"Lord Kennedy of Southwark","listAs":"Kennedy of Southwark, L.","memberFrom":"Life peer","party":"Labour","partyColour":"d50000","partyAbbreviation":"Lab","partyIsMainParty":true},{"memberId":4157,"name":"Baroness Wheeler","listAs":"Wheeler, B.","memberFrom":"Life peer","party":"Labour","partyColour":"d50000","partyAbbreviation":"Lab","partyIsMainParty":true